# The combo of a single Joy-Con (DMN-07): SL+SR, which SDL reports as
# leftshoulder and rightshoulder when it is held sideways. Both are bound
# here, so the members of the combo hold keys: LCtrl and LShift go down,
# and the combo fires 2 s after the second, at 2300, which lets go of both
# and pauses. While paused, a tap of leftshoulder maps nothing. Holding
# both again resumes at 6100; they were held across the resume, so their
# ups map nothing, and a new press of leftshoulder holds LCtrl again.
# The Joy-Con is joycon-separate's.
